    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 4,
     "text": "Learn more about “two brands” products at one Pop-Up…"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "STINGERS"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>From Boston to the Berkshires, Stingers brings big flavor and serious fire to the Bay State. Our Massachusetts lineup is all about craft, potency, and pure satisfaction — featuring full-flower infused pre-rolls, slow-burning blunts, and our newest flavor-driven innovation, SWEETS by Stingers.</p><p>Each product is handcrafted using premium full flower, and high-grade cannabis extracts for smooth, flavorful, and reliable potency. Whether you’re rolling through Worcester or chilling on the Cape, Stingers delivers flavor you can taste and strength you can trust.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/stingers/\"><strong>Click here to shop Stingers products</strong></a></p><hr>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "HAVN EXTRACTS IS A CRAFT CANNABIS COMPANY",
     "demote": true
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>All of us at HAVN Extracts love what we do, and are working daily to provide our customers with innovative, pure and natural products! High quality inputs yield high quality outputs is the philosophy that guides us. All of our products are made not just with the best cannabis, but premium, all natural ingredients as well.</p><p>Whether you’re using HAVN products for sleep assistance, pain management, or just for pleasure, we thank you for placing your trust in us!</p><p><a href=\"/brands/havn/\"><strong>Click here to shop HAVN products</strong></a></p>"
    },
    {
